  "ingredients": [
    "1.25 cups buttermilk",
    "0.25 cup vegetable oil",
    "0.5 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "1.25 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1.5 teaspoons baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "1 dash salt",
    "1 egg",
    "1 teaspoon lemon juice",
    "1 tablespoon butter, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PFm-dKxYtP6lJi7QdyC6Zm5WHTo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/214499-my-hop-pancakes-ddmfs-step-1-97-4x3-f52658fea66940d0b9a30fbc51f84844.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214499/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix buttermilk, vegetable oil, and vanilla in a bowl; stir in sugar. Whisk in flour, baking powder, baking soda, and salt, combining the batter with just a few strokes to moisten. Leave the lumps.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JT0jbaOiVxQN_SKRHRmMZARg-M8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/214499-my-hop-pancakes-ddmfs-step-4-103-4x3-796ae4fe1b3442c8b0d431322b6d3f6b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214499/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk egg and lemon juice together in a separate bowl; gently stir into the batter. Refrigerate the batter for at least 30 minutes, up to 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/46-Z2ban7smPRFlIbqMYgOU6zgk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/214499-my-hop-pancakes-ddmfs-step-5-104-4x3-8b89a2b40cab4b0ab9dd0cb7f9925352.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214499/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a large skillet over medium heat and grease with the butter. Pour 1/3 cup of batter per pancake into the skillet and cook until bubbles appear on the surface, about 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AePMbemAdC_TWUgkBss5QSOpwAs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/214499-my-hop-pancakes-ddmfs-step-6-110-4x3-fd1724b293ba4249ab9650cbbe408cc7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214499/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Flip with spatula and brown the other side, about 2 more minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kwP_zO6by7jNaejuoh0PwJi4e6k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/214499-my-hop-pancakes-ddmfs-step-7-111-4x3-a4205a20f1a14cc4896555d76379f08d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214499/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
